tter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/da6949/{size}.png","created_at":"2022-11-04T14:08:50.606Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eNice post.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHave to say trading is so ridiculously broken on certain civs and on larger maps\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/original/3X/c/b/cb6851dda9bf30505ad86711d79c9811edf78bfc.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/cb6851dda9bf30505ad86711d79c9811edf78bfc\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/b/cb6851dda9bf30505ad86711d79c9811edf78bfc_2_638x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"t1qqHiaLuLEMKkHjbAWfnm4EhOs\" width=\"638\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/b/cb6851dda9bf30505ad86711d79c9811edf78bfc_2_638x500.jpeg, https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/original/3X/c/b/cb6851dda9bf30505ad86711d79c9811edf78bfc.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/original/3X/c/b/cb6851dda9bf30505ad86711d79c9811edf78bfc.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2E3948\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\n\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e679×532 111 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n23min game even when like 10-15 traders died in feudal / castle\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":11,"post_type":1,"posts_count":11,"updated_at":"2022-11-04T14:09:01.470Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":19,"readers_count":18,"score":23.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":182222,"topic_slug":"some-facts-about-trade","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":106423,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/some-facts-about-trade/182222/11","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":813815,"username":"DrAllurian","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.ageofempires.com/drallurian/{size}/91087_2.png","created_at":"2022-11-04T22:47:52.611Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThis post was made at about the launch of the game, where trade was very good on 3v3 and larger. They’ve just made trade better so it’s maybe passable in 1v1, which is to say it’s completely busted in 2v2 and higher.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou haven’t lived until you’ve been French with Chamber of Commerce on 4v4. A perfectly balanced and flexible, Imp level income starting early Feudal. It’s pretty filthy.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":12,"post_type":1,"posts_count":11,"updated_at":"2022-11-04T22:47:52.611Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":11,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":17,"readers_count":16,"score":28.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":182222,"topic_slug":"some-facts-about-trade","primary_group_name":"Age_Insider","flair_name":"Age_Insider","flair_url":"//cdn.ageofempires.com/aoe-forums/original/3X/5/7/57ac945b03e64b35defdd85916e382852840f723.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":56,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"[Age Insider] Age IV Beta","title_is_group":false,"reply_to_user":{"id":106423,"username":"BdelloidBore5","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/da6949/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":86771,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/some-facts-about-trade/182222/12","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":813869,"username":"HaleTortoise579","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.ageofempires.com/haletortoise579/{size}/105728_2.png","created_at":"2022-11-05T01:06:02.375Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThere were a couple vids a looong time ago that cover the some details about map sizes and income and the maximum net income of the basic 8 civs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"vozzYiTHO-U\" data-video-title=\"AoE4 - Trader Efficiency + Analysis [Gigantic map only - updated vid in description for all sizes]\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\"\u003e\n  \u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vozzYiTHO-U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\n    \u003cimg class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/uploads/default/original/3X/6/1/61e4a019eea1124b64e3eae5d109b3570cea2b3d.jpeg\" title=\"AoE4 - Trader Efficiency + Analysis [Gigantic map only - updated vid in description for all sizes]\" data-dominant-color=\"7B898E\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\"\u003e\n  \u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e##########################################################\u003cbr\u003e\nThe channel seems dead unfortunately, but the vids are a convinent background for land trade details.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSome personal notes with respect to sea trade is that the best sea trades seem like they might be French, Otto, and Abba right off the bat. French iirc has an unconditional +50% trade boost to water trade (stacks with Chamber of Commerce?) and can choose a main resouce, Otto have a gigantic income/speed/armor boost with Sea Gate Palace since that makes more sense on water maps (keeps on neutral docs for buff and fighting ships), and Abba just have a slightly lower income for a more practical trade system.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":13,"post_type":1,"posts_count":11,"updated_at":"2022-11-05T01:06:03.864Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":7,"reads":15,"readers_count":14,"score":58.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":182222,"topic_slug":"some-facts-about-trade","primary_group_name":"Age_Insider","flair_name":"Age_Insider","flair_url":"//cdn.ageofempires.com/aoe-forums/original/3X/5/7/57ac945b03e64b35defdd85916e382852840f723.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":56,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vozzYiTHO-U","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"AoE4 - Trader Efficiency + Analysis [Gigantic map only - updated vid in description for all sizes] - YouTube","clicks":3}],"read":true,"user_title":"Age Insider","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":113510,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/some-facts-about-trade/182222/13","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false},{"id":813872,"username":"DrAllurian","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.ageofempires.com/drallurian/{size}/91087_2.png","created_at":"2022-11-05T01:26:26.657Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHaha, that’s the channel I tired to link to but the filter went mad. My original post was made at about the same time as those were made.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote group-Age_Insider\" data-username=\"HaleTortoise579\" data-post=\"13\" data-topic=\"182222\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.ageofempires.com/user_avatar/forums.ageofempires.com/haletortoise579/48/105728_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e HaleTortoise579:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSome personal notes with respect to sea trade is that the best sea trades seem like they might be French, Otto, and Abba right off the bat. French iirc has an unconditional +50% trade boost to water trade (stacks with Chamber of Commerce?) and can choose a main resouce, Otto have a gigantic income/speed/armor boost with Sea Gate Palace since that makes more sense on water maps (keeps on neutral docs for buff and fighting ships), and Abba just have a slightly lower income for a more practical trade system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI hope it continues to change, but all of this is so theoretical as to be pointless to consider. To trade (which is excellent regardless of civ), you need to win water and that will happen probably early Feudal and not based on your potential trade income. Especially in the case of Otto, the boost could be to give inf gold per trip but so long as it’s stuck behind an Imp landmark choice and building 2+ keeps not on the frontline it can’t meaningfully be good. Water is too valuable to have not decided the game before this effect can even be chosen.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo steal some terminology from card games, these are all “win more” bonuses, and it’s probably better for your win percentage to ignore them.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":15,"post_type":1,"posts_count":11,"updated_at":"2022-11-05T01:26:26.657Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":13,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":16,"reads":13,"readers_count":12,"score":82.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":182222,"topic_slug":"some-facts-about-trade","primary_group_name":"Age_Insider","flair_name":"Age_Insider","flair_url":"//cdn.ageofempires.com/aoe-forums/original/3X/5/7/57ac945b03e64b35defdd85916e382852840f723.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":56,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"[Age Insider] Age IV Beta","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":86771,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/some-facts-about-trade/182222/15","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_translate":false}],"stream":[624276,624295,624299,624314,813331,813382,813476,813484,813815,813869,813872]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,1808],[5,1449],[9,1448]],"suggested_topics":[{"fancy_title":"Idea for Variable Scout Speed","id":281797,"title":"Idea for Variable Scout Speed","slug":"idea-for-variable-scout-speed","posts_count":1,"reply_count":0,"highest_post_number"